        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">This dataset includes a method of producing lithium fluoride out of lithium carbonate and hydrogen fluoride under ambient conditions (no heating, no cooling, no pressure). Lithium carbonate conversion is 95.5%.\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset includes the reaction of lithium carbonate with hydrogen fluoride in an autoklave to lithium fluoride, carbon dioxide and water. The reaction temperatur is 21°C (no need to cool or heat). Energy consumption to evaporate water to dry the salt and CO2 emissions to air from the reaction are calculated. For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted. Transportation efforts are based on ecoinvent standard estimates.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
